2026-06-11 15:01:34,146 | AGENT | SecurityCompliance Agent answered: As a Security & Compliance officer at Faber IA, I can confirm that our company has experience in delivering solutions compliant with GDPR, especially for public-sector and health clients, including special-category health data as per Article 9. 

