By leveraging our existing security controls, including secure software development lifecycle practices (such as code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing), vulnerability management with defined remediation SLAs, and an incident response plan, we can provide a robust solution that meets the tender's stringent regulatory requirements regarding data protection and sovereignty.
